```
https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-renzo/blob/519e518f2d8dec9acf6482b84a181e403070d22d/contracts/Delegation/OperatorDelegator.sol#L147C8-L148C39

## Tools Used
Manual Review

## Recommended Mitigation Steps
Implement a check before calling the `deposit` function on the `operatorDelegator` to ensure that `_amount` is greater than zero:

```solidity
if (_amount > 0) {
    operatorDelegator.deposit(_collateralToken, _amount);
}
```


