When a withdrawal request is made, it compares the buffer, formatted in the desired collateral token, with the amountToRedeem in ETH. This comparison results in comparing the amount of LST to the converted ETH amount. Based on their exchange rate, the function might attempt to withdraw more than the buffer allows, or it will revert.

