Imagine there's 5 ODs, and 3 collateral tokens: stETH, wbETH, mETH.

Let's debug the first iteration of the [external loop](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-renzo/blob/519e518f2d8dec9acf6482b84a181e403070d22d/contracts/RestakeManager.sol#L289-L349):
