https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-renzo/blob/main/contracts/Withdraw/WithdrawQueue.sol#L279

Furthermore, when choosing where to put new deposits, the system looks at how much each operator delegator has and how much total value is locked up. 
```solidity
