```

As we can see, the token TVL accumulated by iterating over the operator delegators array and adding the amount for the token to it:

https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-04-renzo/blob/main/contracts/RestakeManager.sol#L521
```js
    uint256 odLength = operatorDelegatorTokenTVLs.length;
